      "text": "I _think_ I've figured it out.\n\nIf I want to give a SVG object an apparent depth, I can use a scale transform using the formula:\n\n~~~PowerShell\n1/[Math]::Pow(2, $scale - 1)\n~~~\n\nThe transform-origin controls where it scales to.\n\nDo you all see depth in this image?"
